            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Codex Whip 1.10.2

The whip cracks when Codex Whip opens.

• Opening the app plays the whip sound once. Quitting stays silent.
• New installs start with Whip Sound and Automatic Updates on. Your current choices stay as they are.
• The installer window spells out the three first-launch steps for macOS's security check.

macOS 14 or later. This community build is ad hoc signed and is not Apple-notarized.
